    narr:narration """Quinton Fairweather has established a [mandatory gate for Meridian deployments](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1), requiring a signed release manifest for all artifacts moving into [staging and production](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4). This directive is framed as a [formal decision](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) rooted in a [past operational failure](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), where unsigned artifacts reached staging. Fairweather’s communication style here is strictly administrative and authoritative, [identifying himself as the owner](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_5) of this new control point. The narrative is currently singular, focusing on the implementation of this conservation-oriented policy to prevent recurrence of previous errors.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2> ;
